<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-VELEZ BEAT CRUZEIRO 1-0 IN FIRST LEG OF SUPERCUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VELEZ BEAT CRUZEIRO 1-0 IN FIRST LEG OF SUPERCUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BELO HORIZONTE, Brazil 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Velez Sarsfield</p>
<p>(Argentina) beat Cruzeiro (Brazil) 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in the</p>
<p>first leg of the South American Supercup final on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer - Jose Luis Chilavert (86th minute, penalty)</p>
<p>Attendance: 61,641</p>
<p>Second leg to be played December 4.</p>
<p>Note: the Supercup is played every year between past</p>
<p>winners of the Libertadores Cup.</p>
</text>
